{"id":"CG_120_02","names":{"0":"","???":"???","avg1_120":"Canace","avg3_100":"Sylar","avg3_999":"???"},"en":{"0":"","???":"???","avg1_120":"Canace","avg3_100":"Sylar","avg3_999":"???"},"tx":1,"steps":[["intro","Act Two","The Secret After-Class Paper (Part II)","Burst in! Boom!! Unexpected Guests!!!"],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["bgm","m57"],["say","avg3_999","In the beginning, the God created the Monolith. God said, \"Let wishes be granted,\" and so the Monolith could fulfill endless wishes. God saw that it was good.",9,""],["say","avg3_999","Professor, I don't understand. The book says the God of Grace created the Monolith, but Trekkers never find any trace of the God inside it.",9,""],["say","avg3_999","The ■■■ of Grace... How did everyone's ■■■■... What exactly is God ■■■——?",9,""],["w",0.5],["say","0","If ■■■■■■■■ never ■■■, then did ■■■■ ever really ■■?",8,""],["w",0.5],["say","0","Professor, why is everyone looking at me?",8,""],["bgm",""],["clear",1,1.0,1],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_120","a","004",null,-0.45,1.4,5,null,null],["bg","hospital_inside",5,0.0],["cbg",5,null,null,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["stage",5,0,2],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_120","a",null,"sleepy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",1.0],["say","avg1_120","Professor...",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",2,"z","025","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","Canace!? Are you okay?",1,""],["mrt",4,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_120","a","019","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jingxia","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_120","Ah!==W== Oh... ==PLAYER_NAME==, it's you... You startled me.",0,""],["bgm","m28"],["w",0.6],["ctl","avg1_120","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_120","a",null,"vexation",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_120","Wh-what is this place?",0,""],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_120","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["hide","avg1_120",0.5],["w",0.3],["stage",5,0,10],["w",0.3],["cbg",5,null,null,1.0,"Linear",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["stage",5,1,3],["bg","hospital_inside",0,0.0],["w",0.2],["cbg",0,null,null,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_100"],["obj","qstory_side_120_001",0,null,0.58],["w",1.5],["mrt",1,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","We're at a clinic. You don't remember? You collapsed as soon as you stepped out of the lift. I feared the worst, but it turned out you were just asleep.",1,""],["say","avg3_100","But I couldn't get you to wake up, so I had to carry you back myself.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z","002",null,null],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_120","Oh... Yeah, now that you mention it...",0,""],["objx"],["w",1.3],["se","se_204"],["show","avg1_120","a","007",0.5,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_120","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",1.2],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_120","a",null,"vexation",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_120","S-Sorry about that. What happened back there...==W== Um... I hope you would just forget it.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["say","avg1_120","I said I'd protect you myself... Sigh... This is really embarrassing.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",2,"z","002","attention","stop"],["say","avg3_100","No, no, I don't blame you at all. Nothing bad happened in the end.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","012",null,null],["say","avg3_100","But... Why did you fall asleep like that? Are you not feeling well?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_120","a","017","flurry",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_120","Ahem... Probably just from a serious lack of sleep. I was up all night working on experiments both yesterday and the day before.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_120","a","008",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_120","Normally, I'd squeeze in a nap whenever I had a chance... But things have been so hectic lately I haven't had a chance.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","010","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","Now I'm all worried for you...",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","012",null,null],["say","avg3_100","No matter how busy, you still gotta rest.",1,""],["say","avg3_100","Collapsing like that would scare anyone. You could've gotten hurt, especially inside the Monolith with all those Stellaroids around.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_120","a","011",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_120","Yes, I'll be more careful from now on...==W== B-By the way, you didn't run into any trouble inside the Monolith, did you?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_120","a","007","attention",null,null,null,null,"jushou0","Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","018","star",null],["say","avg3_100","Don't worry. Even without magic, I'm still a capable Trekker. Dodging Stellaroids is no big deal for me.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_120","a","007","flurry",null,null,null,null,"niunie","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_120","I see... Sorry for the trouble. Anyway, I'm feeling much better now. Shall we get going?",0,""],["w",0.3],["bgm",""],["se","se_148"],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.7],["ctl","avg1_120","a","017",null,0.35,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["ctl","avg1_120","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["hide","avg1_120",0.5],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"OutSine",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.0],["w",0.8],["mrt",2,"z","025","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","Hold hold, Canace—where are you going? I think you should get some more rest.",1,""],["mrt",4,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.3],["chd",0,0,"avg1_120","a","017","flurry"],["say","avg1_120","No need, I feel well-rested already. Let's get ready and head back to the Monolith—we can't waste any more time.",0,""],["chd",1,0,"avg1_120","a","002",null],["w",0.5],["se","se_093"],["w",1.0],["bg","wog_academy_office",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,50.0,null,1.1,"Linear",0.4,null,null,null],["w",0.4],["show","avg1_120","a","002",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg1_120","a","007",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.6],["w",0.8],["bgm","m2"],["mrt",1,"z","025","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Why are you in such a hurry? Is your paper's deadline coming up?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z","002",null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_120","a","017",null,0.52,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_120","No, this is my personal research. There's no deadline involved.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","I really think we should stop for today. You say you're rested, but as far as I can tell, you only slept for two hours.",1,""],["say","avg3_100","Speaking from experience, it's not a good idea to head into the Monolith when you're not in good shape. It tends to not end up well.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z","002",null,null],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_120","a","007","vexation",null,-0.01,0.95,null,null,"OutSine",1.0],["say","avg1_120","But... I don't want to waste precious time.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",2,"z","023","music",null],["say","avg3_100","Besides, I've already got all the data you wanted.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z","002",null,null],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_120","a","003","attention",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.6],["w",0.6],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg1_120","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_120","a",null,null,0.3,null,1.0,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.0],["se","se_021"],["obj","qstory_main_05_001",0,null,null],["w",1.8],["ctl","avg1_120","a","010","exclamation",null,null,1.0,1.0,"jushou0","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_120","These data ... are 100% complete!",0,""],["objx"],["w",0.8],["ctl","avg1_120","a","007",null,0.5,0.0,1.0,null,null,"OutSine",0.7],["w",0.7],["say","avg1_120","==PLAYER_NAME==, how did you manage this? With that many Stellaroids in there...",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","023","star",null],["say","avg3_100","As I said, I am a Trekker after all. Finding a spot without Stellaroids and unleashing your scroll to activate the magic circle wasn't all that hard.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z","002",null,null],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_120","Amazing. Only a truly experienced Trekker could've pulled that off. Thank you so much, ==W====PLAYER_NAME==! Whatever reward you want, just name it—",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_074"],["ctl","avg1_120","a","010",null,null,-0.1,1.1,null,"jushou0","Linear",0.28],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","003",null,null],["say","avg3_100","I don't need any reward, but in exchange, I hope you could tell me...",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Why are you in such a hurry with your Monolith research?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z","002",null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["ctl","avg1_120","a","011","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_120","Why...",0,""],["ctl","avg1_120","a","009","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",0.5],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg1_120","a","007",null,null,-0.2,1.2,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_120","==PLAYER_NAME==... Come closer.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","025","shock",null],["say","avg3_100","Huh? Is it a top secret?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z","002",null,null],["w",0.3],["se","se_009"],["ctl","avg1_120","a","010",null,null,-0.55,1.8,null,null,"OutSine",3.0],["w",3.5],["se","se_257"],["ctl","avg1_120","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_120","You cannot tell another soul about this. The reason I'm in such a hurry is because...",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","015",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Because...?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.3],["clear",1,0.5,1],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.5],["w",0.8],["se","se_226"],["chd",0,1,"avg1_120","a","010",null],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_120","I don't think the God of Grace exists.==W== Or to be precise, if the God of Grace does exist, it's nothing like what everyone imagines.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",2,"z","025","exclamation","jingxia2"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Xiao"],["say","avg3_